<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PJOK SMP Zone - Belajar Olahraga Seru & Interaktif</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans & Fredoka -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        smpCyan: '#00F5D4',
                        smpBlue: '#00BBF9',
                        smpPurple: '#9B5DE5',
                        smpPink: '#F15BB5',
                        smpYellow: '#FEE440',
                        darkNavy: '#0F172A',
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        heading: ['Fredoka', 'sans-serif'],
                        body: ['Plus Jakarta Sans', 'sans-serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
        }
        h1, h2, h3, .font-heading {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;
        }
        .sport-card-hover {
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }
        .sport-card-hover:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.01);
        }
        .glass-effect {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }
        .badge-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00BBF9 0%, #9B5DE5 100%);
        }
        /* Custom scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #F1F5F9;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #00BBF9;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800 antialiased selection:bg-smpCyan selection:text-darkNavy">

    <!-- HEADER / NAVIGATION BAR -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 glass-effect border-b-2 border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center h-20">
                <!-- Logo -->
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 cursor-pointer" onclick="window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: 'smooth'})">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-tr from-smpBlue to-smpPurple rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl shadow-lg shadow-smpBlue/30 transform -rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-volleyball"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading tracking-wide text-darkNavy">PJOK<span class="text-smpBlue">SMP</span><span class="text-smpPink">.ZONE</span></span>
                        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">Materi Jasmani & Kesehatan SMP</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Desktop Nav -->
                <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-2 font-heading text-base">
                    <a href="#bola-besar" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:text-smpBlue hover:bg-blue-50 transition">Bola Besar</a>
                    <a href="#bola-kecil" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:text-smpPurple hover:bg-purple-50 transition">Bola Kecil</a>
                    <a href="#atletik" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:text-smpPink hover:bg-pink-50 transition">Atletik</a>
                    <a href="#kebugaran" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-50 transition">Kebugaran</a>
                    <a href="#kuis-smp" class="ml-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-smpBlue to-smpPurple text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition">Kuis Seru <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad ml-1"></i></a>
                </nav>

                <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->
                <div class="md:hidden">
                    <button id="mobile-menu-btn" class="text-slate-700 hover:text-smpBlue focus:outline-none p-2 text-2xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars-staggered"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile Menu Dropdown -->
        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden md:hidden bg-white border-b-2 border-slate-100 px-4 pt-2 pb-6 space-y-2 font-heading">
            <a href="#bola-besar" class="mobile-link block px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-smpBlue">🏀 Permainan Bola Besar</a>
            <a href="#bola-kecil" class="mobile-link block px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:bg-purple-50 hover:text-smpPurple">🏸 Permainan Bola Kecil</a>
            <a href="#atletik" class="mobile-link block px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:bg-pink-50 hover:text-smpPink">🏃 Atletik (Lari & Lompat)</a>
            <a href="#kebugaran" class="mobile-link block px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-slate-700 hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-600">💪 Kebugaran Jasmani</a>
            <a href="#kuis-smp" class="mobile-link block px-4 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-smpBlue to-smpPurple text-white font-bold text-center rounded-xl shadow-md">Uji Kuis SMP <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i></a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50 via-purple-50/40 to-slate-50 py-16 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Floating shapes background -->
        <div class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-20 h-20 bg-smpCyan/20 rounded-full blur-xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-smpPink/20 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white rounded-full shadow-sm border border-slate-200 mb-6">
                        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-smpCyan rounded-full animate-ping"></span>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase tracking-wider">Kurikulum Merdeka / K13 - Tingkat SMP</span>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-darkNavy leading-tight mb-6">
                        Kuasai Olahraga, <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-smpBlue via-smpPurple to-smpPink">Tubuh bugar & berprestasi!</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
                        Pelajari teknik dasar cabang olahraga populer, prinsip kebugaran tubuh, dan uji pemahamanmu dengan kuis interaktif yang seru!
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">
                        <a href="#materi-utama" class="px-8 py-4 bg-darkNavy text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition text-center sport-card-hover flex items-center justify-center">
                            Mulai Belajar <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down ml-3 text-smpCyan"></i>
                        </a>
                        <a href="#kuis-smp" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white text-darkNavy border-2 border-slate-200 font-heading font-bold text-lg rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:bg-slate-50 transition text-center sport-card-hover flex items-center justify-center">
                            Tantangan Kuis <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy ml-3 text-smpYellow"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hero Graphic Card -->
                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-2xl border-2 border-slate-100 relative z-10">
                        <div class="relative h-64 sm:h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574629810360-7efbbe195018?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Siswa SMP Olahraga" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-darkNavy/80 via-transparent to-transparent flex items-end p-6">
                                <div class="text-white">
                                    <span class="bg-smpPink text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase">Penting untuk SMP</span>
                                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading mt-1">Teknik & Strategi Olahraga</h3>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Mini Badges Grid -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center font-heading">
                            <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-basketball text-smpBlue text-2xl mb-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Bola Besar</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-3 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-table-tennis-paddle-ball text-smpPurple text-2xl mb-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Bola Kecil</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-3 bg-pink-50 rounded-xl">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-person-running text-smpPink text-2xl mb-1"></i>
                                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">Atletik</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SEARCH & QUICK FILTER -->
    <section id="materi-utama" class="py-8 bg-white border-y border-slate-200">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-darkNavy font-heading">Cari Materi Olahraga</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Ketik nama materi atau teknik dasar yang ingin kamu pelajari</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="w-full md:w-96 relative">
                    <input type="text" id="search-input" placeholder="Cari: Passing, Smash, Lari, Kebugaran..." 
                           class="w-full pl-11 pr-4 py-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 focus:border-smpBlue focus:outline-none text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-4 top-3.5 text-slate-400"></i>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MATERI 1: PERMAINAN BOLA BESAR -->
    <section id="bola-besar" class="py-16 bg-slate-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-smpBlue text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">01</div>
                <span class="text-smpBlue font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">Modul Pembelajaran</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-darkNavy font-heading mb-4">Permainan Bola Besar</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl">Cabang olahraga beregu yang menggunakan bola berukuran besar. Membutuhkan kerja sama tim dan fisik yang prima.</p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Sepak Bola -->
                <div class="sport-card bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-lg sport-card-hover flex flex-col" data-keywords="sepak bola dribbling passing shooting gawang kaki">
                    <div class="relative h-48">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508098682722-e99c43a406b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Sepak Bola" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-darkNavy/80 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm">Sepak Bola</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-darkNavy font-heading mb-2">Sepak Bola</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Dimainkan oleh 2 tim (11 pemain/tim) selama 2 x 45 menit untuk mencetak gol sebanyak-banyaknya.</p>
                            
                            <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
                                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-smpBlue mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Passing (Mengoper):</strong> Gunakan kaki bagian dalam untuk operan akurat.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-smpBlue mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Dribbling (Menggiring):</strong> Mendorong bola perlahan sambil tetap mengontrol posisinya.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-blue-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-smpBlue mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Shooting (Menembak):</strong> Menendang keras ke arah gawang lawan dengan punggung kaki.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Bola Voli -->
                <div class="sport-card bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-lg sport-card-hover flex flex-col" data-keywords="bola voli passing bawah atas smash block net">
                    <div class="relative h-48">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612872087720-bb876e2e67d1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Bola Voli" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-darkNavy/80 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm">Bola Voli</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-darkNavy font-heading mb-2">Bola Voli</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Dimainkan oleh 2 tim (6 pemain/tim) memantulkan bola melewati net tanpa menyentuh lantai area sendiri.</p>
                            
                            <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
                                <div class="bg-purple-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-smpPurple mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Passing Bawah:</strong> Merapatkan kedua lengan lurus ke depan saat menahan/mengoper bola.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-purple-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-smpPurple mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Passing Atas:</strong> Mendorong bola menggunakan jari-jari kedua tangan di atas dahi.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-purple-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-smpPurple mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Smash / Pukulan Keras:</strong> Melompat dan memukul bola tajam ke lapangan lawan.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Bola Basket -->
                <div class="sport-card bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 shadow-lg sport-card-hover flex flex-col" data-keywords="bola basket dribble lay up shooting ring chest pass lay-up">
                    <div class="relative h-48">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546519638-68e109498ffc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Bola Basket" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                        <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-darkNavy/80 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full backdrop-blur-sm">Bola Basket</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-darkNavy font-heading mb-2">Bola Basket</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Dimainkan oleh 2 tim (5 pemain/tim) dengan memasukkan bola ke keranjang lawan untuk mendapat poin.</p>
                            
                            <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
                                <div class="bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Chest Pass:</strong> Operan setinggi dada menggunakan dorongan dua tangan.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Dribble:</strong> Memantulkan bola ke lantai dengan satu tangan sambil bergerak.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-start space-x-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 mt-0.5"></i>
                                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-700">
                                        <strong class="text-darkNavy">Lay-up Shot:</strong> Tembakan melayang mendekati ring dengan 2 langkah kaki.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MATERI 2: PERMAINAN BOLA KECIL -->
    <section id="bola-kecil" class="py-16 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-smpPurple text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">02</div>
                <span class="text-smpPurple font-bold text-sm tracking-wider uppercase">Modul Pembelajaran</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-darkNavy font-heading mb-4">Permainan Bola Kecil</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl">Menggunakan raket atau pemukul dengan objek kecil seperti kok atau bola tenis. Melatih kelincahan dan refleks cepat.</p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <!-- Bulutangkis -->
                <div class="sport-card bg-purple-50/50 border-2 border-purple-100 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center" data-keywords="bulutangkis badminton forehand backhand smash shuttlecock kok raket">
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2 h-52 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626224583764-f87db24ac4ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Bulutangkis" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2">
                        <span class="bg-smpPurple text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Bulutangkis (Badminton)</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-darkNavy font-heading mt-2 mb-3">Bulutangkis</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4">Tujuannya menyeberangkan shuttlecock melewati net ke lapangan lawan agar lawan tidak bisa mengembalikannya.</p>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right text-smpPurple font-bold"></i>
                                <span><strong>Pegangan Forehand:</strong> Seperti berjabat tangan.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right text-smpPurple font-bold"></i>
                                <span><strong>Pegangan Backhand:</strong> Ibu jari menekan di bagian pipih raket.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right text-smpPurple font-bold"></i>
                                <span><strong>Servis & Smash:</strong> Pukulan pembuka dan pukulan keras menukik.</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tenis Meja -->
                <div class="sport-card bg-emerald-50/50 border-2 border-emerald-100 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center" data-keywords="tenis meja pingpong bet shakehand penhold push drive block">
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2 h-52 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534158914592-062992fbe900?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Tenis Meja" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full sm:w-1/2">
                        <span class="bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Tenis Meja (Pingpong)</span>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-darkNavy font-heading mt-2 mb-3">Tenis Meja</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4">Dimainkan di atas meja berukuran khusus yang dipisahkan oleh net kecil menggunakan alat pemukul kayu berlapis karet (Bet).</p>
                        
                        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right text-emerald-600 font-bold"></i>
                                <span><strong>Shakehand Grip:</strong> Memegang bet seperti berjabat tangan.</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right text-emerald-600 font-bold"></i>
                                <span><strong>Penhold Grip:</strong> Memegang bet seperti memegang pena.</span>
                            </div>
